Read @ARCHITECTURE.md before changing the integration.

- Keep scoring in look_intent/scoring.py for Chalk and local fallback parity.
- Prediction authorizes hover only; completed dwell or validated voice authorizes picks.
- Keep voice actions scoped to current expiring questions; validate IDs locally.
- Learn only from explicit corrections and successful outcome callbacks.
- Use MockArm until the physical adapter independently enforces motion checks.
- Keep synthetic logs labelled and separate from reported rehearsal results.
- Run `PYTHONPATH=intent python -m unittest discover -s intent/tests`.
- Never commit API keys, personal logs or user memory files.
